<div class="space-y-12">
    <div>
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-4">Benchmarks</h1>
        <p class="text-lg text-slate-400">SoliKV against Redis 7.4.11 and Redis 8.10.2, all built from source on one machine, AOF on with <code class="text-indigo-400 bg-indigo-500/10 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-xs">appendfsync everysec</code>, three alternating rounds on fresh servers (2026-10-01)</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Highlight -->
    <div class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-emerald-500/10 border border-emerald-500/30 space-y-3">
        <p class="text-slate-300">With many clients writing to the same key, SoliKV handles <strong class="text-emerald-400">1.4&ndash;2.7&times; the throughput of Redis 8.10</strong>: network I/O and parsing run on every core, and only execution is serialized on the key's shard. Pipelined writes lead too. One command at a time, all four servers sit at the limit of a single benchmark client (~112&ndash;122K req/s).</p>
        <p class="text-slate-300">Redis keeps the edge on ZRANK and deep ZRANGE, on snapshots next to a huge key (it forks), and clearly on refilling right after a FLUSHALL of 1M keys. Everything is listed below, including where SoliKV is behind.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-white/5"><div class="text-2xl font-bold font-mono text-emerald-400">3.64M/s</div><div class="text-sm text-slate-300 mt-2">SET on one hot key</div><div class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">Redis 8.10: 1.35M/s · Redis 7.4: 1.54M/s</div></div>
        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-white/5"><div class="text-2xl font-bold font-mono text-emerald-400">3.20M/s</div><div class="text-sm text-slate-300 mt-2">HSET on one hot key</div><div class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">Redis 8.10: 1.27M/s · Redis 7.4: 1.31M/s</div></div>
        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-white/5"><div class="text-2xl font-bold font-mono text-emerald-400">1.75M/s</div><div class="text-sm text-slate-300 mt-2">pipelined SET, P=16</div><div class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">Redis 8.10: 1.17M/s · Redis 7.4: 1.32M/s</div></div>
    </div>

    <!-- Hot key -->
    <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4 flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-amber-500/20 flex items-center justify-center"><svg class="w-5 h-5 text-amber-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17.657 18.657A8 8 0 016.343 7.343S7 9 9 10c0-2 .5-5 2.986-7C14 5 16.09 5.777 17.656 7.343A7.975 7.975 0 0120 13a7.975 7.975 0 01-2.343 5.657z" /></svg></span>
            One hot key (6 client threads, 96 connections, P=32, 20M ops)
        </h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mb-4">All clients on the same key. Best value of each row in green.</p>
            <div class="overflow-x-auto">
            <table class="w-full text-left">
            <thead><tr class="border-b border-white/10"><th class="py-3 pr-4 text-slate-400 font-medium">Command</th><th class="py-3 pr-4 text-slate-400 font-medium">SoliKV</th><th class="py-3 pr-4 text-slate-400 font-medium">SoliKV --solo</th><th class="py-3 pr-4 text-slate-400 font-medium">Redis 7.4</th><th class="py-3 pr-4 text-slate-400 font-medium">Redis 8.10</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody class="text-slate-300">
            <tr class="border-b border-white/5"><td class="py-3 pr-4">SET</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono"><span class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold">3.64M/s</span></td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">2.00M/s</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">1.54M/s</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">1.35M/s</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-white/5"><td class="py-3 pr-4">GET</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono"><span class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold">5.71M/s</span></td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">2.76M/s</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">3.07M/s</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">3.07M/s</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-white/5"><td class="py-3 pr-4">INCR</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono"><span class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold">3.48M/s</span></td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">2.05M/s</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">1.74M/s</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">1.60M/s</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-white/5"><td class="py-3 pr-4">LPUSH</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono"><span class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold">2.28M/s</span></td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">1.40M/s</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">1.43M/s</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">1.35M/s</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-white/5"><td class="py-3 pr-4">HSET</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono"><span class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold">3.20M/s</span></td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">1.63M/s</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">1.31M/s</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">1.27M/s</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="py-3 pr-4">ZADD</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono"><span class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold">2.96M/s</span></td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">1.60M/s</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">2.28M/s</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">2.10M/s</td></tr>
            </tbody>
            </table>
            </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Everyday commands -->
    <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4 flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-indigo-500/20 flex items-center justify-center"><svg class="w-5 h-5 text-indigo-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M8 9l3 3-3 3m5 0h3M5 20h14a2 2 0 002-2V6a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2z" /></svg></span>
            Everyday commands (50 clients)
        </h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mb-4">Standard <code class="text-xs">redis-benchmark</code>. One command at a time, the benchmark client is the limit for every server; pipelined, it is close to it.</p>
        <div class="space-y-6">
            <div>
                <h3 class="font-semibold mb-2">Pipelined, P=16 (2M ops)</h3>
            <div class="overflow-x-auto">
            <table class="w-full text-left">
            <thead><tr class="border-b border-white/10"><th class="py-3 pr-4 text-slate-400 font-medium">Command</th><th class="py-3 pr-4 text-slate-400 font-medium">SoliKV</th><th class="py-3 pr-4 text-slate-400 font-medium">SoliKV --solo</th><th class="py-3 pr-4 text-slate-400 font-medium">Redis 7.4</th><th class="py-3 pr-4 text-slate-400 font-medium">Redis 8.10</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody class="text-slate-300">
            <tr class="border-b border-white/5"><td class="py-3 pr-4">SET</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono"><span class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold">1.75M/s</span></td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">1.56M/s</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">1.32M/s</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">1.17M/s</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-white/5"><td class="py-3 pr-4">GET</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">1.75M/s</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono"><span class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold">1.82M/s</span></td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">1.78M/s</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">1.77M/s</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-white/5"><td class="py-3 pr-4">INCR</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono"><span class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold">1.73M/s</span></td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">1.60M/s</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">1.45M/s</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">1.31M/s</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-white/5"><td class="py-3 pr-4">LPUSH</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono"><span class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold">1.52M/s</span></td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">1.41M/s</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">1.22M/s</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">1.18M/s</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-white/5"><td class="py-3 pr-4">SADD</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">1.69M/s</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">1.47M/s</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">1.73M/s</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono"><span class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold">1.81M/s</span></td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-white/5"><td class="py-3 pr-4">HSET</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono"><span class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold">1.73M/s</span></td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">1.26M/s</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">1.10M/s</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">1.07M/s</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="py-3 pr-4">ZADD</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">1.70M/s</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">1.23M/s</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono"><span class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold">1.71M/s</span></td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">1.65M/s</td></tr>
            </tbody>
            </table>
            </div>
            </div>
            <div>
                <h3 class="font-semibold mb-2">One command at a time (200k ops)</h3>
            <div class="overflow-x-auto">
            <table class="w-full text-left">
            <thead><tr class="border-b border-white/10"><th class="py-3 pr-4 text-slate-400 font-medium">Command</th><th class="py-3 pr-4 text-slate-400 font-medium">SoliKV</th><th class="py-3 pr-4 text-slate-400 font-medium">SoliKV --solo</th><th class="py-3 pr-4 text-slate-400 font-medium">Redis 7.4</th><th class="py-3 pr-4 text-slate-400 font-medium">Redis 8.10</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody class="text-slate-300">
            <tr class="border-b border-white/5"><td class="py-3 pr-4">PING INLINE</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">118.3K/s</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">119.3K/s</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">119.2K/s</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono"><span class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold">119.7K/s</span></td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-white/5"><td class="py-3 pr-4">PING MBULK</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">116.3K/s</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono"><span class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold">120.2K/s</span></td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">117.7K/s</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">120.0K/s</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-white/5"><td class="py-3 pr-4">SET</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">117.1K/s</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono"><span class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold">120.1K/s</span></td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">119.8K/s</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">120.0K/s</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-white/5"><td class="py-3 pr-4">GET</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">116.6K/s</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">118.3K/s</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">118.6K/s</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono"><span class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold">120.1K/s</span></td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-white/5"><td class="py-3 pr-4">INCR</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">119.3K/s</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">118.5K/s</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">118.6K/s</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono"><span class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold">119.7K/s</span></td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-white/5"><td class="py-3 pr-4">LPUSH</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">112.1K/s</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">119.4K/s</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">116.8K/s</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono"><span class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold">119.7K/s</span></td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-white/5"><td class="py-3 pr-4">RPUSH</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">113.2K/s</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">115.4K/s</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono"><span class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold">119.5K/s</span></td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">119.2K/s</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-white/5"><td class="py-3 pr-4">LPOP</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">115.7K/s</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono"><span class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold">122.0K/s</span></td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">119.1K/s</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">119.8K/s</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-white/5"><td class="py-3 pr-4">RPOP</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">117.4K/s</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">118.8K/s</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">120.0K/s</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono"><span class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold">120.3K/s</span></td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-white/5"><td class="py-3 pr-4">SADD</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">116.1K/s</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">119.2K/s</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">117.8K/s</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono"><span class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold">119.8K/s</span></td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-white/5"><td class="py-3 pr-4">HSET</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">115.4K/s</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">119.0K/s</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">118.1K/s</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono"><span class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold">120.0K/s</span></td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-white/5"><td class="py-3 pr-4">ZADD</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">118.6K/s</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono"><span class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold">120.1K/s</span></td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">119.0K/s</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">119.6K/s</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="py-3 pr-4">MSET</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">117.8K/s</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono"><span class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold">121.1K/s</span></td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">118.1K/s</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">118.9K/s</td></tr>
            </tbody>
            </table>
            </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Data structures -->
    <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4 flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-emerald-500/20 flex items-center justify-center"><svg class="w-5 h-5 text-emerald-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M20 7l-8-4-8 4m16 0l-8 4m8-4v10l-8 4m0-10L4 7m8 4v10M4 7v10l8 4" /></svg></span>
            Data structures
        </h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mb-4">Workloads whose cost depends on how values are stored. Durations are for the whole workload; rates are operations per second.</p>
            <div class="overflow-x-auto">
            <table class="w-full text-left">
            <thead><tr class="border-b border-white/10"><th class="py-3 pr-4 text-slate-400 font-medium">Workload</th><th class="py-3 pr-4 text-slate-400 font-medium">SoliKV</th><th class="py-3 pr-4 text-slate-400 font-medium">SoliKV --solo</th><th class="py-3 pr-4 text-slate-400 font-medium">Redis 7.4</th><th class="py-3 pr-4 text-slate-400 font-medium">Redis 8.10</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody class="text-slate-300">
            <tr class="border-b border-white/5"><td class="py-3 pr-4">SETBIT growing a 10 MB bitmap (100k calls)</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">114.0 ms</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono"><span class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold">104.5 ms</span></td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">131.8 ms</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">134.1 ms</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-white/5"><td class="py-3 pr-4">APPEND building a 10 MB string (20k calls)</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">34.7 ms</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono"><span class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold">23.6 ms</span></td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">45.3 ms</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">46.5 ms</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-white/5"><td class="py-3 pr-4">ZRANK, 200k-member sorted set</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">538.0K/s</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">607.4K/s</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono"><span class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold">619.7K/s</span></td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">609.7K/s</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-white/5"><td class="py-3 pr-4">ZRANGE 10 members deep in a 200k sorted set</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">373.1K/s</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">407.6K/s</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono"><span class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold">439.8K/s</span></td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">437.9K/s</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-white/5"><td class="py-3 pr-4">Full ZSCAN, 50k members</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono"><span class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold">21.1 ms</span></td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">21.6 ms</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">37.0 ms</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">31.0 ms</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-white/5"><td class="py-3 pr-4">Full HSCAN, 50k fields</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">19.9 ms</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono"><span class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold">17.4 ms</span></td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">24.1 ms</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">20.5 ms</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-white/5"><td class="py-3 pr-4">SINTER 100k-member set with 100-member set</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">73.6K/s</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono"><span class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold">73.6K/s</span></td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">63.1K/s</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">65.3K/s</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-white/5"><td class="py-3 pr-4">SPOP until a 100k set is empty</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">118.6 ms</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono"><span class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold">117.4 ms</span></td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">151.5 ms</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">153.9 ms</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-white/5"><td class="py-3 pr-4">One MSET of 10k pairs</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">3.92 ms</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">3.80 ms</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono"><span class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold">3.68 ms</span></td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">4.09 ms</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-white/5"><td class="py-3 pr-4">One RPUSH of 100k elements</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">14.5 ms</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono"><span class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold">13.4 ms</span></td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">14.9 ms</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">14.6 ms</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="py-3 pr-4">One DEL of 1000 keys</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">234 µs</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">204 µs</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">221 µs</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono"><span class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold">203 µs</span></td></tr>
            </tbody>
            </table>
            </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Latency -->
    <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4 flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-cyan-500/20 flex items-center justify-center"><svg class="w-5 h-5 text-cyan-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" /></svg></span>
            Latency seen by other clients
        </h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mb-4">GET/SET latency of 16 clients while the server saves, and while they refill right after a FLUSHALL.</p>
            <div class="overflow-x-auto">
            <table class="w-full text-left">
            <thead><tr class="border-b border-white/10"><th class="py-3 pr-4 text-slate-400 font-medium">Measurement</th><th class="py-3 pr-4 text-slate-400 font-medium">SoliKV</th><th class="py-3 pr-4 text-slate-400 font-medium">SoliKV --solo</th><th class="py-3 pr-4 text-slate-400 font-medium">Redis 7.4</th><th class="py-3 pr-4 text-slate-400 font-medium">Redis 8.10</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody class="text-slate-300">
            <tr class="border-b border-white/5"><td class="py-3 pr-4">GET p99.9 during BGSAVE (1M keys, 16 clients)</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">843 µs</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">803 µs</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono"><span class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold">573 µs</span></td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">745 µs</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-white/5"><td class="py-3 pr-4">GET worst during BGSAVE</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono"><span class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold">2.80 ms</span></td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">18.4 ms</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">5.08 ms</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">3.41 ms</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-white/5"><td class="py-3 pr-4">GET p99.9 while SAVE runs</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">774 µs</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono"><span class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold">600 µs</span></td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">651 µs</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">807 µs</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-white/5"><td class="py-3 pr-4">GET worst while SAVE runs</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono"><span class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold">80.6 ms</span></td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">357.3 ms</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">551.1 ms</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">445.1 ms</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-white/5"><td class="py-3 pr-4">SET p99.9 refilling after FLUSHALL of 1M keys</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">5.37 ms</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">14.3 ms</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">2.20 ms</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono"><span class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold">1.95 ms</span></td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-white/5"><td class="py-3 pr-4">SET worst refilling after FLUSHALL</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">79.9 ms</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">62.1 ms</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono"><span class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold">4.86 ms</span></td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">6.03 ms</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-white/5"><td class="py-3 pr-4">Other keys, worst, BGSAVE with a 2M-element list</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">4.59 ms</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">4.39 ms</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono"><span class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold">1.30 ms</span></td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">1.69 ms</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="py-3 pr-4">Other keys, worst, BGREWRITEAOF with a 2M-element list</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">2.71 ms</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">3.26 ms</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono"><span class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold">1.70 ms</span></td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono">2.34 ms</td></tr>
            </tbody>
            </table>
            </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Reading -->
    <div class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-amber-500/10 border border-amber-500/30 space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-amber-400">Reading these numbers</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-300"><span class="text-white font-semibold">One command at a time</span>, a single <code class="text-indigo-400 text-xs">redis-benchmark</code> process saturates near 120K req/s before any of the servers does; the four are within noise of each other.</p>
        <p class="text-slate-300"><span class="text-white font-semibold">One hot key</span> is where SoliKV's design shows: network I/O and command parsing run on every core, and only execution is serialized on the key's shard. Redis runs everything on one thread (<code class="text-indigo-400 text-xs">io-threads 1</code>, its default). SoliKV is 1.4–2.7× Redis 8.10 there; <code class="text-indigo-400 text-xs">--solo</code>, which has Redis' shape, lands at the same level as Redis. Redis' <code class="text-indigo-400 text-xs">io-threads</code> option was not tried.</p>
        <p class="text-slate-300"><span class="text-white font-semibold">Pipelined</span>, the single benchmark client is again close to its limit (GET is level everywhere). SoliKV leads on SET, INCR, LPUSH and HSET; Redis leads on SADD and matches on ZADD.</p>
        <p class="text-slate-300"><span class="text-white font-semibold">Data structures</span> are comparable. SoliKV is faster growing strings (SETBIT, APPEND), on full ZSCAN, SINTER and SPOP; Redis is 13–15% faster on ZRANK and 17–18% faster on deep ZRANGE than SoliKV's default mode.</p>
        <p class="text-slate-300"><span class="text-white font-semibold">Snapshots:</span> Redis forks for BGSAVE and BGREWRITEAOF; SoliKV saves in steps under each shard's lock. With 1M small keys, SoliKV's worst GET during BGSAVE is the lowest of the four (2.8 ms against 3.4–5.1 ms), with p99.9 slightly higher (0.80–0.84 ms against 0.57–0.75 ms). Next to a 2M-element list, other keys of that shard see up to 4.6 ms on SoliKV against 1.3–1.7 ms on Redis. SAVE blocks every Redis client for the whole save (worst 445–551 ms here); SoliKV's SAVE holds one shard at a time in its default mode (worst 81 ms).</p>
        <p class="text-slate-300"><span class="text-white font-semibold">Refill after a FLUSHALL of 1M keys is SoliKV's weak spot:</span> worst SET 62–80 ms against 5–6 ms for Redis, p99.9 5–14 ms against about 2 ms.</p>
        <p class="text-slate-300">Client and server share one 16-thread CPU and the desktop was in use during the run (load average 3–6), spread evenly by alternating the servers. On a real disk, AOF-heavy numbers would be lower for every server.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Before / after -->
    <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4 flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-purple-500/20 flex items-center justify-center"><svg class="w-5 h-5 text-purple-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 4v5h.582m15.356 2A8.001 8.001 0 004.582 9m0 0H9m11 11v-5h-.581m0 0a8.003 8.003 0 01-15.357-2m15.357 2H15" /></svg></span>
            Before and after the audit fixes
        </h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mb-4">SoliKV 0.4.3 (<code class="text-xs">main</code> 6645a90) against the audit-fix branch (7109ba1), same machine and settings, data directories on tmpfs.</p>
        <div class="space-y-6">
            <div>
                <h3 class="font-semibold mb-2">Data structures</h3>
            <div class="overflow-x-auto">
            <table class="w-full text-left">
            <thead><tr class="border-b border-white/10"><th class="py-3 pr-4 text-slate-400 font-medium">Workload</th><th class="py-3 pr-4 text-slate-400 font-medium">Before</th><th class="py-3 pr-4 text-slate-400 font-medium">After</th><th class="py-3 pr-4 text-slate-400 font-medium">Speedup</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody class="text-slate-300">
            <tr class="border-b border-white/5"><td class="py-3 pr-4">Growing a bitmap with SETBIT — 100k SETBITs at rising offsets, 10 MB at the end</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono text-slate-400">40.96 s</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono text-emerald-400">105.3 ms</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono text-emerald-400"><span class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold">×389</span></td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-white/5"><td class="py-3 pr-4">ZRANGE by index, deep — 10 members from rank 100k–190k of 200k</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono text-slate-400">3.2K/s</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono text-emerald-400">405.5K/s</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono text-emerald-400"><span class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold">×126</span></td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-white/5"><td class="py-3 pr-4">Building a string with APPEND — 20k appends of 512 B, 10 MB at the end</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono text-slate-400">2.89 s</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono text-emerald-400">23.0 ms</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono text-emerald-400"><span class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold">×126</span></td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-white/5"><td class="py-3 pr-4">A full ZSCAN — sorted set of 50k members, COUNT 100</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono text-slate-400">2.59 s</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono text-emerald-400">20.7 ms</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono text-emerald-400"><span class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold">×125</span></td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-white/5"><td class="py-3 pr-4">SINTER, large with small — 100k-member set with a 100-member set</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono text-slate-400">0.9K/s</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono text-emerald-400">75.5K/s</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono text-emerald-400"><span class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold">×81</span></td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-white/5"><td class="py-3 pr-4">ZRANK — random members of a 200k-member sorted set</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono text-slate-400">7.9K/s</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono text-emerald-400">583.0K/s</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono text-emerald-400"><span class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold">×74</span></td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-white/5"><td class="py-3 pr-4">A full HSCAN — hash of 50k fields, COUNT 100</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono text-slate-400">698.4 ms</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono text-emerald-400">18.4 ms</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono text-emerald-400"><span class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold">×38</span></td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-white/5"><td class="py-3 pr-4">Emptying a set with SPOP — 100k members, one SPOP at a time</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono text-slate-400">275.6 ms</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono text-emerald-400">113.6 ms</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono text-emerald-400"><span class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold">×2.4</span></td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-white/5"><td class="py-3 pr-4">One RPUSH of 100k elements — a single 1.3 MB command</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono text-slate-400">15.4 ms</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono text-emerald-400">12.0 ms</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono text-emerald-400"><span class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold">×1.3</span></td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-white/5"><td class="py-3 pr-4">One MSET of 10k pairs — a single 10k-pair command</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono text-slate-400">4.25 ms</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono text-emerald-400">3.31 ms</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono text-emerald-400"><span class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold">×1.3</span></td></tr>
            <tr><td class="py-3 pr-4">DEL of 1000 keys — keys spread over all shards</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono text-slate-400">234 µs</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono text-emerald-400">211 µs</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono text-emerald-400"><span class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold">×1.1</span></td></tr>
            </tbody>
            </table>
            </div>
            </div>
            <div>
                <h3 class="font-semibold mb-2">One hot key</h3>
            <div class="overflow-x-auto">
            <table class="w-full text-left">
            <thead><tr class="border-b border-white/10"><th class="py-3 pr-4 text-slate-400 font-medium">Command</th><th class="py-3 pr-4 text-slate-400 font-medium">Before</th><th class="py-3 pr-4 text-slate-400 font-medium">After</th><th class="py-3 pr-4 text-slate-400 font-medium">Change</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody class="text-slate-300">
            <tr class="border-b border-white/5"><td class="py-3 pr-4">SET</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono text-slate-400">2.96M/s</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono text-emerald-400">3.81M/s</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono text-emerald-400">+29%</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-white/5"><td class="py-3 pr-4">INCR</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono text-slate-400">1.40M/s</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono text-emerald-400">3.48M/s</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono text-emerald-400">+148%</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-white/5"><td class="py-3 pr-4">HSET</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono text-slate-400">2.05M/s</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono text-emerald-400">3.33M/s</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono text-emerald-400">+63%</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-white/5"><td class="py-3 pr-4">ZADD</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono text-slate-400">2.35M/s</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono text-emerald-400">3.20M/s</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono text-emerald-400">+36%</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="py-3 pr-4">LPUSH</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono text-slate-400">3.33M/s</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono text-amber-400">2.50M/s</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono text-amber-400">−25%</td></tr>
            </tbody>
            </table>
            </div>
                <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mt-3">LPUSH lost ground because the new server compacts its AOF automatically, and each rewrite saves the single 20M-element list while writers to it wait; with <code class="text-xs">--auto-aof-rewrite-percentage 0</code> it ran at 3.08M/s against 2.58&ndash;2.67M/s before.</p>
            </div>
            <div>
                <h3 class="font-semibold mb-2">Latency while saving</h3>
            <div class="overflow-x-auto">
            <table class="w-full text-left">
            <thead><tr class="border-b border-white/10"><th class="py-3 pr-4 text-slate-400 font-medium">Measurement</th><th class="py-3 pr-4 text-slate-400 font-medium">Before</th><th class="py-3 pr-4 text-slate-400 font-medium">After</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody class="text-slate-300">
            <tr class="border-b border-white/5"><td class="py-3 pr-4">BGSAVE, worst GET — 1M keys over 16 shards, 16 clients</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono text-slate-400">14.1 ms</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono text-emerald-400">3.27 ms</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-white/5"><td class="py-3 pr-4">BGSAVE, GET p99.9 — 1M keys over 16 shards, 16 clients</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono text-slate-400">2.43 ms</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono text-emerald-400">795 µs</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-white/5"><td class="py-3 pr-4">SAVE, worst GET — other clients while SAVE runs</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono text-slate-400">200.0 ms</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono text-emerald-400">74.2 ms</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-white/5"><td class="py-3 pr-4">SAVE, GET p99.9 — other clients while SAVE runs</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono text-slate-400">2.46 ms</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono text-emerald-400">664 µs</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-white/5"><td class="py-3 pr-4">BGSAVE in --solo mode, worst GET — 1M keys, single-threaded engine</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono text-slate-400">1.21 ms</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono text-emerald-400">1.51 ms</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-white/5"><td class="py-3 pr-4">BGSAVE in --solo mode, GET p99.9 — 1M keys, single-threaded engine</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono text-slate-400">181 µs</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono text-emerald-400">275 µs</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-white/5"><td class="py-3 pr-4">Refill after FLUSHALL, worst SET — 1M keys flushed, then 16 clients write</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono text-slate-400">220.9 ms</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono text-emerald-400">88.1 ms</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-white/5"><td class="py-3 pr-4">Refill after FLUSHALL, SET p99.9 — 1M keys flushed, then 16 clients write</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono text-slate-400">8.66 ms</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono text-emerald-400">4.16 ms</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-white/5"><td class="py-3 pr-4">BGSAVE of a 2M-element list, worst — GET/LPUSH on other keys of that shard</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono text-slate-400">15.7 ms</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono text-emerald-400">1.99 ms</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="py-3 pr-4">BGSAVE of a 2M-element list, p99.9 — GET/LPUSH on other keys of that shard</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono text-slate-400">66 µs</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono text-emerald-400">217 µs</td></tr>
            </tbody>
            </table>
            </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mt-3">Standard and pipelined <code class="text-xs">redis-benchmark</code> were level (&plusmn;3%). The notes and every table are in <code class="text-indigo-400">benches/RESULTS.md</code>, along with the July 2026 comparison of 0.4.1 with Redis, whose pipelined-SET lead was not like-for-like.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Optimizations -->
    <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">Architecture &amp; Optimizations (0.5)</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 p-3 rounded-lg bg-white/5">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-emerald-400 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
                <span class="text-slate-300">Shards keyed by cluster slot, each a parking_lot mutex; consecutive pipelined commands on one shard share a lock hold</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 p-3 rounded-lg bg-white/5">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-emerald-400 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
                <span class="text-slate-300">Command table resolved once per command; replies encoded straight into the write buffer</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 p-3 rounded-lg bg-white/5">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-emerald-400 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
                <span class="text-slate-300">Per-shard append-only log written under the shard lock, collected by a writer thread</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 p-3 rounded-lg bg-white/5">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-emerald-400 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
                <span class="text-slate-300">mimalloc global allocator</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 p-3 rounded-lg bg-white/5">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-emerald-400 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
                <span class="text-slate-300">Order-statistic sorted sets; in-place string mutation; lazy *SCAN iteration</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 p-3 rounded-lg bg-white/5">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-emerald-400 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
                <span class="text-slate-300">Incrementally growing keyspace map (no stop-the-world rehash)</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 p-3 rounded-lg bg-white/5">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-emerald-400 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
                <span class="text-slate-300">Stepped snapshots: a shard is held only while its part is captured</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 p-3 rounded-lg bg-white/5">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-emerald-400 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
                <span class="text-slate-300">Timer-driven active expiry (--hz) and sampled LRU/LFU eviction</span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Reproduce -->
    <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">Reproduce</h2>
        <div class="rounded-xl bg-slate-900 border border-white/10 p-5 font-mono text-sm text-slate-300 space-y-2 overflow-x-auto">
            <div class="text-slate-500"># SoliKV built for measurement (fat LTO); Redis from its sources</div>
            <div>rbuild --faithful --no-link kv &amp;&amp; cp target/remote/release/solikv /tmp/solikv</div>
            <div>make -C redis-7.4.11 redis-server &amp;&amp; make -C redis-8.10.2 redis-server</div>
            <div class="text-slate-500 pt-2"># four servers, three alternating rounds, then the tables</div>
            <div>cd benches &amp;&amp; (cd loadgen &amp;&amp; go build -o loadgen .)</div>
            <div>python3 versus.py results-vs/ "SoliKV=solikv:/tmp/solikv:--save ''" \</div>
            <div>&nbsp;&nbsp;"SoliKV --solo=solikv:/tmp/solikv:--solo --save ''" \</div>
            <div>&nbsp;&nbsp;"Redis 7.4=redis:redis-7.4.11/src/redis-server" "Redis 8.10=redis:redis-8.10.2/src/redis-server"</div>
            <div>python3 report_versus.py results-vs/</div>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mt-3">Requirements, scenarios and options: <code class="text-indigo-400">benches/README.md</code>. Every table: <code class="text-indigo-400">benches/RESULTS.md</code>.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Test Environment -->
    <div class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-slate-900 border border-white/10">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-4">Test Environment</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 font-mono text-sm">
            <div><div class="text-slate-500 text-xs uppercase mb-1">CPU</div><div class="text-white">AMD Ryzen 7 255 (16 threads)</div></div>
            <div><div class="text-slate-500 text-xs uppercase mb-1">RAM</div><div class="text-white">27 GiB</div></div>
            <div><div class="text-slate-500 text-xs uppercase mb-1">OS</div><div class="text-white">Linux 7.2 x86_64</div></div>
            <div><div class="text-slate-500 text-xs uppercase mb-1">SoliKV</div><div class="text-white">49ff314, 16 shards and --solo</div></div>
            <div><div class="text-slate-500 text-xs uppercase mb-1">Redis</div><div class="text-white">7.4.11 and 8.10.2, jemalloc, io-threads 1</div></div>
            <div><div class="text-slate-500 text-xs uppercase mb-1">Tools</div><div class="text-white">redis-benchmark 7.4.2, benches/loadgen</div></div>
